<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.scratch.runs ~ the docker-run-rm of memory: ephemeral by default

`lares sensorium run <path> [<analysis…>]` opens a scratch mempalace under `<cache>/scratch/sensoriums/<id>/`, ingests the path, runs the analysis the trailing words name, and dissolves the instance on exit, on success or error alike; `keep=true` retains it, and `name=` labels it. The deep ingest (bands, structure, form) stands documented and unbuilt.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ run · kept

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`run` params=`path/notes ~ ingest a path and dissolve on exit`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`kept` params=`path/notes keep/true name/notes-pass ~ retain the sensorium under a name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ path · analysis · keep · name

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`path` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<path> ~ the path to ingest`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`analysis` params=`takes/words seat/2 as/<analysis…> ~ the analysis the trailing words name`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`keep` params=`~ retain the sensorium instead of dissolving it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`name` params=`takes/name ~ a label for the sensorium`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

